        <item>
            <title>Version 1.3</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>More file formats: JPG, TIFF (8/16 bit), DNG, HEIC, ARW, NEF, RAF, CR2, ORF and RW2</li>
<li>New update window with patch notes</li>
<li>Right-click "Show in Finder" for photos and folders in the grid, viewer, compare and sidebar</li>
<li>Press I in the viewer to show or hide camera settings (there is also a switch in Settings)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li>Much faster browsing when holding down an arrow key</li>
<li>Thumbnail info cards show camera details on four rows with a bold file name</li>
<li>Camera settings stay on screen in the viewer</li>
<li>Favorites in the sidebar expand on their own</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Welcome text now says the reject key is Backspace</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/jakobthefrog/Gallra/releases/download/v1.3/Gallra-1.3.zip"
